Package: coniv
Type: Package
Title: Multicenter Multiple Confounding Instrumental Variables (MCM-CONIV) Model
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Qingxin", "Luo", email = "luoqingxin@mail.sdu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Implements the multicenter multiple confounding instrumental
    variables (MCM-CONIV) model, which estimates a common causal effect across
    observational centers that share one reference sample. The implementation
    supports continuous outcomes and binary-outcome risk differences, four
    strategies for confounding instrumental (CON-IV) variables,
    influence-function covariance estimation, and feasible generalized least
    squares with the full cross-center covariance.
